[[p:11566|Jayden Daniels]] (250.16). The season high was 170.02 in week 8 ([[g:2024-08-1-2]]). In the Dynasty Playoffs they lost to [[f:1|Mojo Dojo Casa Team]] 144.90-224.94 in the First Round, then beat [[f:6|got that DAWG]] 168.52-136.36 in the Fifth Place Game and finished 5th. The front office made 48 transactions, 6 of them trades. Young Sexy Award winners on the roster at season's end: Jayden Daniels (QB)."},{"season":"2025","heading":"2025: Storm FC","text":"Under Alex, Storm FC went 4-10 to finish as the No. 10 seed, scoring 1410.05 points, 11th in the league. [[p:8112|Drake London]] led the club with 187.10 points in 13 starts, followed by [[p:8110|Jake Ferguson]] (167.70). The season high was 171.18 in week 4 ([[g:2025-04-2-8]]). In the Toilet Bowl they lost to [[f:3|Kolkata Kommies]] 78.10-117.56 in the Toilet Bowl First Round, then lost to [[f:4|Win one game]] 85.40-115.28 in the Toilet Bowl Semifinal, then beat [[f:12|Happy Feet]] 113.08-44.94 in the Toilet Bowl Final and finished 11th. The front office made 48 transactions, 13 of them trades."},{"season":"2026","heading":"2026: Storm FC","text":"Through 4 games under Alex, Storm FC are 1-3 and 9th in the standings, with 549.26 points (6th). [[p:8151|Kenneth Walker]] led the club with 118.80 points in 4 starts, followed by [[p:8167|Christian Watson]] (77.10). The season high was 149.26 in week 1 ([[g:2026-01-2-9]]). The front office made 20 transactions, 6 of them trades."}],"moves":[{"season":"2023","trades":5,"claims":12,"signings":23,"adds":35,"releases":29,"gs":64,"pts":896.52},{"season":"2024","trades":6,"claims":14,"signings":19,"adds":33,"releases":36,"gs":37,"pts":316.14},{"season":"2025","trades":13,"claims":15,"signings":15,"adds":30,"releases":29,"gs":65,"pts":498.66},{"season":"2026","trades":6,"claims":1,"signings":9,"adds":10,"releases":13,"gs":13,"pts":122.96}]}